INT. EMERGENCY ROOM - TRAUMA BAY - NIGHT

Monitors beep. A body on a gurney. Blood on gloves.

DR. AMARA OKONKWO-REID, 40s, bent over a bleeding patient. NURSE THEO LINDQVIST, 30s, squeezes a bag of saline.

AMARA
Pressure?

THEO
Sixty over thirty.

AMARA
Clamp.

He hands it. She clamps. Blood stops. The monitor steadies.

THEO
Holding.

AMARA
Hold it.

The patient seizes. Both leap. Theo pins an arm. Amara pins the other. The monitor screams, then flatlines. They freeze.

THEO
Doc?

AMARA
Paddles. Now.

He slaps them in her hands. She charges. The patient jerks. A blip. Another blip. They both exhale.
